Third-party data
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The fetchers in src/data/ retrieve data from third-party providers. That data
is NOT redistributed by this repository and remains under each provider's own
terms:

  - OHLCV klines ............ Binance public API (Binance API Terms of Use)
  - Funding rate ............ Binance USD-M perpetuals API
  - Fear & Greed index ...... alternative.me API
  - US Dollar Index (DTWEXBGS) FRED, Federal Reserve Bank of St. Louis
                              (U.S. federal government data, public domain)

Each user fetches this data under the original provider's terms. This
repository provides the code to fetch and process it, not the data itself.
